## ObjectType: Mandate Limit

Approved dated portfolio/entity control: issuer securities-asset ratio or USD unsettled-receivable cap, with knowledge and effective dates kept separate.

Local operational extension; no FIBO equivalence asserted.

### Data Properties

| Name | Display Name | Type | Description | Mapped Field |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| limit_id | Limit Id | string | Stable unique identifier of this business record. | limit_id |
| portfolio_id | Portfolio Id | string | Foreign key to portfolios; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | portfolio_id |
| entity_id | Entity Id | string | Foreign key to legal_entities; blank only where contract declares absent/inapplicable evidence. | entity_id |
| measure | Measure | string | issuer_ratio uses a 0–1 securities-asset share; receivable_amount uses a USD amount. Allowed values: issuer_ratio, receivable_amount. | measure |
| threshold | Threshold | decimal | Limit in its declared measure: 0–1 ratio or USD amount; strictly greater breaches, equality does not. | threshold |
| currency | Currency | string | USD for amount limits; blank for dimensionless ratios. | currency |
| effective_from_date | Effective From Date | date | Inclusive first valid business date of this limit version. | effective_from_date |
| effective_to_date | Effective To Date | date | Inclusive last valid business date of this limit version. | effective_to_date |
| approval | Approval | string | Explicit controlled state/reason; absence never implies completion or acceptance. Allowed values: approved. | approval |
| decision_date | Decision Date | date | Date the limit was approved and known, distinct from its effective interval. | decision_date |

### Keys

Primary Keys: limit_id
Display Key: limit_id
